{#- Official C++ per-table header template (design §22 G2).
    Registered under the target's `file_template` name (default
    `{table}.h`), rendered once per table in name order. Decisions are
    precomputed in context: `header_what`, the sorted `includes` set,
    `enums_header`, `namespace`, `banner_head`/`banner_desc`,
    `struct_name` (allocated against the shared file-set namespace), and
    `members` (name order — decl line and optional doc). -#}// <auto-generated>
//   Generated by Cage — do not edit.
//   schema: {{ schema_hash | default(value="(unavailable)") }}
//   {{ header_what }}
